    "text": "The crash of Egypt Air Flight 804, which terrorists may have downed over the Mediterranean Sea, provides another tragic reminder of why.",
    "translation": "埃及航空804航班疑遭受恐怖分子袭击而坠毁于地中海，这一悲剧再一次提醒人们为什么要安检。",
