    "text": "But demanding too much of air travelers or providing too little security in return undermines public support for the process.",
    "translation": "但是对乘客要求太多，或向他们提供的安全保障太少，都会削弱公众对于这一安检程序的支持。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "转折并列动名词主语结构",
      "mainClause": "demanding too much... or providing too little... undermines public support for the process.",
      "modifiers": "But 表示转折；or 连接两个并列动名词短语 demanding too much of air travelers 与 providing too little security in return 共同作主语；谓语动词 undermines；宾语 public support for the process。",
      "corePattern": "in return（作为交换/回报）；undermine public support（削弱公众支持）。"
    },
