    },
    "text": "Enhanced security measures since then, combined with a rise in airline travel due to the improving economy and low oil prices, have resulted in long waits at major airports such as Chicago's O'Hare International.",
    "translation": "自那以后安全措施加强，加上航空旅行人数因为经济好转和低油价上升，导致芝加哥奥黑尔国际机场等主要机场等候时间过长。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "复合句（主干+过去分词伴随状语+原因状语）",
      "mainClause": "Enhanced security measures... have resulted in long waits at major airports...",
      "modifiers": "since then 作时间后置定语；combined with... 作伴随状语，其后 due to... 作原因状语修饰 rise in airline travel；such as 举例短语修饰 airports。",
      "corePattern": "combined with（与……结合/加上）；result in（导致/造成）。"
    },
