    "text": "Part of the issue is that the government did not anticipate the steep increase in airline travel, so the TSA is now rushing to get new screeners on the line.",
    "translation": "部分问题在于，政府没有预料到航空旅行人数会大幅增加，因此运输安全管理局正在加紧招募新的机场安检员。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "并列复合句（表语从句+因果并列分句）",
      "mainClause": "Part of the issue is that..., so the TSA is now rushing to get new screeners on the line.",
      "modifiers": "that 引导表语从句说明问题根源；so 引导因果并列分句；rushing to get new screeners 为固定搭配短语。",
      "corePattern": "Part of the issue is that...（部分问题在于……）；rush to do sth.（加紧/急忙做某事）。"
    },
